        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In a world where time is running out with the last breath of life, the Glowing Tree, there is only one chance to save yourself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to reach the Heart before the last light in the Tree is extinguished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large, multi-tiered levels with open gameplay - run, jump, and dodge spikes and clever mechanical traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints are located only in front of particularly dangerous segments - each attempt requires not only agility, but also strategy: remember patterns, plan routes, use a double jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are not small, but they are built in such a way that you will not get lost. There are many variations of traps: spikes, collapsing platforms, flying blades...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take the baton of the Wind?..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>What to expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large multi-tiered levels with open play - freedom of routes and space for tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints only before particularly dangerous segments - every attempt is important; pattern memory and planning are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of traps: spikes, collapsing platforms, flying blades and mechanical traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jump and route choice skills decide the outcome of the race.</p>",
